TeacherController --> AuditLogger
TeacherController --> User
ClassPlanController --> BranchAccessService
ClassPlanController --> ValidationService
ClassPlanController --> AuditLogger
ClassPlanController --> ClassPlan
AttendanceRecordController --> BranchAccessService
AttendanceRecordController --> DateRangeService
