AttendanceRecordController --> AttendanceRecord
FinanceController --> BranchAccessService
FinanceController --> ValidationService
FinanceController --> AuditLogger
FinanceController --> BranchFinanceReport
ProfessionalEventController --> BranchAccessService
ProfessionalEventController --> ValidationService
ProfessionalEventController --> AuditLogger
ProfessionalEventController --> ProfessionalEvent
ProfessionalEventController --> DancerEventAssignment
ProfilePhotoController --> ValidationService
ProfilePhotoController --> User
